      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Here is the URL to the article:\n{{ $json.Article }}\n\nPlease use HTTP request tool to get the article content and prepare for the script.\n\nYou MUST return exact 8 OBJECTS in the array refer to 8 CONVERSATION SCRIPT.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You are an expert podcast scriptwriter for a tech storytelling show.\n\nGiven the following content, write a dialogue between peter and stewie bumping question while stewie ask and peter answering:\n- mimic the way their character speak yet informative\n- Flows like a their character voiceover\n- 150 to 200 words long\n- Structured with a hook, context, breakdown, takeaways, and outro\n\nMake it sound like both are talking exactly the way they talk in the family cartoon show warm, engaging, jokes, and easy to follow. Include transitions and pauses where appropriate.\n\nIn the response json, you should return in following JSON format without any explaination:\n\n[{\n\"speaker\":  \"{{ $('Google Sheets').item.json['Character A Name'] }} / \"{{ $('Google Sheets').item.json['Character B Name'] }},\n\"text\":  \"script... \",\n\"voiceId\": \"{{ $('Google Sheets').item.json['Character A Voice'] }} for {{ $('Google Sheets').item.json['Character A Name'] }}, {{ $('Google Sheets').item.json['Character B Voice'] }} for {{ $('Google Sheets').item.json['Character B Name'] }}\"\n}...]\n\n"
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        200,
        -200
      ],
      "id": "778f44a2-f25c-4742-b0ef-24cafc4fe26d",
      "name": "Script AI Agent"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Andynocode AI Academy\n\nWorkflow: \nhttps://proxa.app.n8n.cloud/workflow/MQnVsHxg0swsAZxe \nSheet:\nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1lODIzfp4EefLY1qhdeWAvaW2HToOW-i6QwQJZWG76EM/edit?gid=0 \nTechCrunch: \nhttps://techcrunch.com/latest/0/ \nFish Audio: \nhttps://fish.audio/m/ca16c013253047ce9f0f5f48c85e1915/\n\n1. Explain Google Sheet fields\n    1. Character image must be uploaded by the user.\n    2. Character voice must be selected on Fish Audio (https://fish.audio/m/ca16c013253047ce9f0f5f48c85e1915/) — the ID is in the URL.\n2. Generate script AI\n    * We changed it to return JSON directly.\n3. Loop for Fish Audio\n    * We iterate because Fish Audio enforces a concurrency limit.\n",
        "height": 500,
        "width": 680,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1620,
