    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsonSchemaExample": "[\n  {\n    \"speaker\": \"Peter\",\n    \"text\": \"Hey Stewie! Did you hear about Apple’s play with Image Playground and ChatGPT? They're trying to jazz it up a bit! \",\n    \"voiceId\": \"d75c270eaee14c8aa1e9e980cc37cf1b\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"speaker\": \"Stewie\",\n    \"text\": \"Oh really, Peter? Isn’t that just a flashy way of saying they’re trying to fix a broken toy? What’s the scoop? \",\n    \"voiceId\": \"ca16c013253047ce9f0f5f48c85e1915\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"speaker\": \"Peter\",\n    \"text\": \"Right? So, when Apple launched this thing, folks were like, 'What is this emoji nonsense?' Image quality was a hot mess! \",\n    \"voiceId\": \"d75c270eaee14c8aa1e9e980cc37cf1b\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"speaker\": \"Stewie\",\n    \"text\": \"Ah, I see! So they thought, 'Hey! Let’s throw ChatGPT in there and pretend it’s gourmet food instead of microwave dinner?' \",\n    \"voiceId\": \"ca16c013253047ce9f0f5f48c85e1915\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"speaker\": \"Peter\",\n    \"text\": \"Exactly! Now users can pick styles—like oil painting or anime. Much better than a six-fingered hand! \",\n    \"voiceId\": \"d75c270eaee14c8aa1e9e980cc37cf1b\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"speaker\": \"Stewie\",\n    \"text\": \"Delightful! So, to sum it up, Apple is upgrading its art little by little, aiming to compete with those cooler image generators out there. \",\n    \"voiceId\": \"ca16c013253047ce9f0f5f48c85e1915\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"speaker\": \"Peter\",\n    \"text\": \"You got it! They’re hoping folks give it another shot with all the new styles! \",\n    \"voiceId\": \"d75c270eaee14c8aa1e9e980cc37cf1b\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"speaker\": \"Stewie\",\n    \"text\": \"Well, isn’t that just a peach? Let's see if they pull it off or end up with another sad failed app! \",\n    \"voiceId\": \"ca16c013253047ce9f0f5f48c85e1915\"\n  }\n]\n"
      },
